Z||000007||JSocha||08-06-2001||12:07 PM||||My fathers top end computer was having so many problems after my sister one weekend installed the WIN98 Plus CD, that I had to eventually redo his system here a month back.  <P>His computer was originally certified for W2K Pro to be installed, however, W2K was still relatively new, that we had WIN 98 installed instead.  I recently installed W2K Pro when I redid his system.<P>Downloaded and applied all the W2K patches and other software/hardware drivers/patches.<P>Now when my father starts it up, it just cranks away and takes forever to load compared to that of when it was a WIN98 SE system w/all the current patches.<P>Debating right now if I am going to redo his system and revert it back to WIN 98 and tell my sister, hands off...no install...of any software...under any circumstances.<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jsocha_2.gif"> ||||reg||1
