Z||000009||loafer87gt||08-06-2001||01:33 PM||||I have my machine setup as a dual boot. I have Win98 installed on it for when I feel like Quake, but other than that I use Win 2000 pro. Win 2000 takes a lot longer to load up, but I found it to be generally faster and a lot more stable. I am able to cue up and animation and let it render at 100% Cpu load and let it sit for a week with no crashes. Lets see Win 98 do that.||||reg||1
Z||000010||Raydar||08-06-2001||01:38 PM||||For day to day stuff, I find ME to be just about as (un)stable as 98 SE. Both of them seem to hang during shutdown.<P>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><BR>Black 88 Formula.<BR>Red 88 Duke coupe. "The Project" <BR>88 Formula parts car. "The Donor"<BR></FONT>||||reg||8
