Z||000012||Boomtastic||08-06-2001||03:41 PM||||I Beta Tested ME for Microsoft .. didn't like it then, and still don't like it now, as it is really just a newer flavor of 98. Do I use it? Yes - on my laptop only, where Windows 2000 doesn't work (display drivers), however I also use Windows XP Pro (another Beta Test), Windows 2000 Advanced Server, Windows 2000 Pro, and Windows 98 SE. (Small home network running here)<P>Sadly, all Windows 9x platforms - ME included - will always have a place in life, since they are the only true way of getting bootable floppies that work across the MS footprint.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P><BR>------------------<BR>Boomtastic<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mirror_md_clr.gif">   <P>[This message has been edited by Boomtastic (edited 08-06-2001).]<p>[This message has been edited by Boomtastic (edited 08-06-2001).]||||reg||13
